  </div></section>
<section style="padding:72px 24px;background:#FAF5EA;">
  <div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">FAQ</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(24px,3.5vw,36px);margin:0 0 32px;">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:8px;padding:24px 28px;">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 10px;">Does Harmattan Solar Co install the system itself?</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;margin:0;">No. This site advertises independent installers and does not install, sell or warrant equipment. The installer who quotes your job is responsible for the work, so get the scope, models and warranty terms written on that quote and keep your receipts.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:8px;padding:24px 28px;">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 10px;">What should a written solar quote list?</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;margin:0;">It should name the exact inverter, battery and panel models, the battery size in kWh, the number and wattage of panels, whether installation is included, the warranty terms and how VAT is treated. If a quote only says '5kVA system', ask for the rest in writing before you compare prices.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:8px;padding:24px 28px;">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 10px;">Why are the prices on this site always dated and attributed?</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;margin:0;">Naira prices move with the exchange rate. Mobility.com.ng wrote in June 2026 that a panel priced at N120,000 can jump to N140,000 a month later because of currency changes, so we only quote what a named seller listed in a named month and tell you to get a current written quote.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
